# Before: PositivePowerCancellation required a literal nonzero integer.
# forall x, y Q+, n Z:
#     n != 0
#     x^n = y^n
#     =>:
#         x = y
# Former result: search_proof failed for symbolic n.
# Now: retain positive bases, integer/nonzero exponent proofs and the stored equality.
forall x, y Q+, n Z:
    n != 0
    x^n = y^n
    =>:
        x = y
# Boundary: exponent zero, noninteger exponents and arbitrary nonzero bases reject.
